# MODEL-10 curation watcher state and run output (cached in CI, not committed)
benchmarks/_curation/state/
benchmarks/_curation/reports/
benchmarks/_curation/drafts/

# MODEL-60 raw CLI streams are never committed
benchmarks/_latency/raw/
